# CogniFocus Landing Page — Windsurf Rules

Read `AI_CONTEXT.md` in this repo root before doing any work here.
Shared product docs → `../cognifocus-docs/`

Stack: Astro 5 · static · Firebase 12 · PostHog
Commands: `npm run dev` · `npm run build` · `npm run sync:cms-content`

Hard rules:
- Never manually edit `src/content/blog/` or `src/content/releases/` — CMS-synced
- Never bypass the mojibake check
- Static output only — no SSR adapters
- All new pages need title, canonical, meta description, OG tags from day one
- CogniFocus is a behavioral focus companion — never describe it as generic productivity
- Never commit `.env` files or tokens
